# Project Overview

## Objective
This project is a full-stack application consisting of a backend implemented with DDD/CQRS patterns and a frontend built using the Atomic Design pattern. The goal is to ensure compatibility with both VSCode webview and web environments.

## Key Requirements
1. Integration of backend and frontend through an API-driven design approach
2. Code generation based on OpenAPI specifications
3. Application of Domain-Driven Design (DDD) and CQRS patterns
4. Structuring frontend components using the Atomic Design pattern
5. Support for both VSCode webview and web browser environments

## Key Deliverables
1. Backend API server
2. Frontend web application
3. VSCode extension